---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';

const studies = [
    {
        title: 'Muscle-building supplement β-hydroxy β-methylbutyrate binds to PPARα to improve hippocampal functions in mice (2023)',
        journal: 'Cell Reports',
        doi: '10.1016/j.celrep.2023.112717',
        finding:
            'Suggests that HMB supports neuronal growth, memory, and learning through PPARα-linked hippocampal pathways.',
        meaning:
            'This work positions HMB beyond muscle metabolism alone, highlighting a differentiated angle for cognitive and brain-health formulations built on UltraHMB™ (HMB-Ca).'
    },
    {
        title: 'Cognitive function is preserved in aged mice following long-term β-hydroxy β-methylbutyrate supplementation (2018/2020)',
        journal: 'Nutritional Neuroscience',
        citation: 'Munroe et al.',
        finding:
            'Long-term HMB supplementation was associated with preserved cognitive function in aged animal models, including active-avoidance learning outcomes.',
        meaning:
            'These findings support exploring HMB-Ca in healthy-aging formulas that target both physical function and cognitive preservation.'
    },
    {
        title: 'Health benefits of β-Hydroxy-β-Methylbutyrate (HMB) supplementation in addition to physical exercise in older adults (2019)',
        journal: 'Nutrients',
        doi: '10.3390/nu11092082',
        finding:
            'Confirmed anticatabolic effects and enhanced protein synthesis in older adults, particularly when combined with exercise.',
        meaning:
            'While primarily muscle-focused, this evidence base underpins broader vitality positioning — physical capability that supports independent, cognitively engaged aging.'
    }
];
---

<Layout
    title="Cognitive Wellness"
    description="Emerging research on HMB-Ca for neuronal support, memory, learning, and cognitive preservation — a differentiated formulation platform with UltraHMB™."
>
    <PageHero
        eyebrow="Applications"
        title="Cognitive Wellness"
        subtitle="Emerging research points to neuronal support, memory, and learning — offering a differentiated angle for cognitive and brain-health formulations with UltraHMB™."
    />

    <section class="section-pad">
        <div class="container-site max-w-4xl prose-site">
            <p>
                Beyond its established role in sports nutrition and muscle preservation, HMB-Ca is gaining attention for
                potential neuroprotective and cognitive applications. As endogenous HMB production declines with age and
                physical stress, supplementation may help support pathways involved in learning, memory, and neuronal
                integrity.
            </p>
            <p>
                UltraHMB™ gives formulators a stable, food-grade calcium salt of HMB to explore this emerging category
                alongside performance and healthy-aging platforms — one ingredient, three research-backed opportunities.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-surface">
        <div class="container-site max-w-4xl space-y-6">
            {
                studies.map((study) => (
                    <article class="study-card">
                        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue">{study.journal}</p>
                        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg">{study.title}</h3>
                        {study.doi ? (
                            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
                                DOI:{' '}
                                <a
                                    href={`https://doi.org/${study.doi}`}
                                    class="text-blue no-underline hover:underline"
                                    target="_blank"
                                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                >
                                    {study.doi}
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        ) : (
                            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">{study.citation}</p>
                        )}
                        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-navy">Finding</p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{study.finding}</p>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-navy">What that means</p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{study.meaning}</p>
                    </article>
                ))
            }
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
        <div class="container-site max-w-4xl">
            <h2>Overall Assessment</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
                Cognitive research on HMB is earlier-stage than the muscle literature, but peer-reviewed work —
                including Cell Reports (Paidi et al., 2023) and Nutritional Neuroscience (Munroe et al.) — supports a
                credible narrative around neuronal growth, memory, and age-related cognitive preservation. For brands
                building brain-health or healthy-aging stacks, UltraHMB™ offers a well-characterized HMB-Ca active with
                dual muscle and cognitive storytelling potential.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <CtaBand />
</Layout>
